cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Smart Elevator CV: A Computer-Vision-Based Approach to
  Energy-Efficient Elevator Control
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ege
    family-names: Karaurgan
    affiliation: Istinye University, Department of Software Engineering
  - given-names: Vedat Efe
